Z||000000||84fierotrevor||11-30-2001||11:54 PM||||I know i need that rear windo part and the bumper anything else ?<BR>screws or anything ?<BR>I am gonna go junkyarding tell I find one.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Tigger||12-01-2001||12:40 AM||||-Rear Clip<BR>-Rear decklid<BR>-Engine vent covers<BR>-Tail light assy's<BR>-Electrical harness - tail lamps will to be re-wired.<BR>-Couple brackets<BR>-GT bumper - you may need to decide on ribbed or smooth mouldings depending on what you can get.  Both ribbed or smooth trimmed bumpers will fit<BR>-You will need to take out the headliner of both cars to unbolt the roof section.  The rear clip has a couple bolts under the roof panel.<P>Just grab as much as you can.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 12-01-2001).]||||reg||1
